# tests/x691/strings2.asn1 in UNALIGNED PER: random values only, against pycrate, asn1c
# and rasn. The reference deviations below were found by those checks.
# asn1c encodes GeneralizedTime and UTCTime with 8 bits per character in
# UPER; they are VisibleStrings (X.691 10.6.5), so 7 bits.
deviates asn1c GT
deviates asn1c UT
deviates pycrate Gen
deviates pycrate Graph
deviates pycrate Tel
deviates pycrate T61
deviates pycrate Vid
deviates pycrate Rec
deviates pycrate BmpA
deviates pycrate Bmp
deviates pycrate Univ
deviates asn1c BmpA
deviates asn1c UnivA
deviates rasn Bmp
deviates rasn BmpS
deviates rasn BmpF
deviates rasn BmpA
deviates rasn BmpX
deviates rasn Tel
deviates rasn T61
deviates rasn UT
deviates rasn GT
deviates rasn Univ
deviates rasn UnivS
deviates rasn UnivA
deviates rasn Rec
deviates-encode rasn Gen
deviates-encode rasn Graph
deviates-encode rasn Vid
